 :</p>\n<p>Now in word \"MANKIND\" we calculated \"A\", so delete \"A\" from previous new alphabet box and check remaining alphabets got right numbers or not in alphabet box.</p>\n<p>As you can see after deleting \"A\", 0<sup>th</sup> positioin in the alphabet box is missing, so we have to create a new alphabet box.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l79ep4sk/1aa80241-a0dc-436c-8af5-3fbdc96cf0a2/aa31c440-24a7-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ep4sl.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l79ep4sk/1aa80241-a0dc-436c-8af5-3fbdc96cf0a2/aa31c440-24a7-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ep4sl.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2022 (Online) 25th July Morning Shift Mathematics - Permutations and Combinations Question 118 English Explanation 4\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l79ep4sk/1aa80241-a0dc-436c-8af5-3fbdc96cf0a2/aa31c440-24a7-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ep4sl.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l79ep4sk/1aa80241-a0dc-436c-8af5-3fbdc96cf0a2/aa31c440-24a7-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ep4sl.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l79ep4sk/1aa80241-a0dc-436c-8af5-3fbdc96cf0a2/aa31c440-24a7-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ep4sl.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l79ep4sk/1aa80241-a0dc-436c-8af5-3fbdc96cf0a2/aa31c440-24a7-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ep4sl.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l79ep4sk/1aa80241-a0dc-436c-8af5-3fbdc96cf0a2/aa31c440-24a7-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ep4sl.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l79ep4sk/1aa80241-a0dc-436c-8af5-3fbdc96cf0a2/aa31c440-24a7-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ep4sl.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"asy