ated \"N\", so delete 3<sup>rd</sup> \"N\" from alphabet box and check remaining alphabets got right number or not in alphabet box. As you can see after deleting 3<sup>rd</sup> \"N\", 3<sup>rd</sup> position is missing in the alphabet box so we have to create a new alphabet box.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l79ewvv3/7e732731-8eaf-4f1e-91a2-d2f8288f1660/81c4fdf0-24a8-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ewvv4.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l79ewvv3/7e732731-8eaf-4f1e-91a2-d2f8288f1660/81c4fdf0-24a8-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ewvv4.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2022 (Online) 25th July Morning Shift Mathematics - Permutations and Combinations Question 118 English Explanation 5\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l79ewvv3/7e732731-8eaf-4f1e-91a2-d2f8288f1660/81c4fdf0-24a8-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ewvv4.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l79ewvv3/7e732731-8eaf-4f1e-91a2-d2f8288f1660/81c4fdf0-24a8-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ewvv4.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l79ewvv3/7e732731-8eaf-4f1e-91a2-d2f8288f1660/81c4fdf0-24a8-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ewvv4.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l79ewvv3/7e732731-8eaf-4f1e-91a2-d2f8288f1660/81c4fdf0-24a8-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ewvv4.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l79ewvv3/7e732731-8eaf-4f1e-91a2-d2f8288f1660/81c4fdf0-24a8-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ewvv4.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l79ewvv3/7e732731-8eaf-4f1e-91a2-d2f8288f1660/81c4fdf0-24a8-11ed-8d2e-5f0df5271c2d/file-1l79ewvv4.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Step 9 :</p>\n<p>Now nex